### Summary of the Plan
The plan involves setting up a NestJS project, installing necessary dependencies, creating an SQLite database, defining data models for users and invitations, implementing business logic in the service layer, and creating controller endpoints for user invitation and creation. The application will be configured to run on port 0.0.0.0:5000 and will be tested against the OpenAPI specifications.

